# Data integrity
- Preserve Spot, Club, Boat, Trainer, Cable Installation as distinct entities; multiple cable installations under one Spot/Club.
- Every imported value must retain provenance, observation timestamp, verification state and uncertainty.
- `unknown` is not `false`, not `0` and not `closed`.
- No fabricated latitude/longitude; only confirmed coordinates become public map pins.
- Treat 80 candidates and six cable matches as incomplete staging. Audit duplicates by source and identity, not by name alone.
- Test spatial queries, constraints, FK and RLS before merging changes.
